{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114788","id":3796759829,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7iTfUV","number":114788,"title":"Tooltips show without transparency on the theme editor preview","user":{"login":"FeymoodDEV","id":219869743,"node_id":"U_kgDODRryLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219869743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV","html_url":"https://github.com/FeymoodDEV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeymoodDEV/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-01-09T12:24:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T09:43:51Z","closed_at":"2026-01-14T23:18:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1.stable.\n\nI noticed this on EndeavourOS/Plasma/Wayland, but it was recreated on Windows by paintsimmon on Discord. All three renderers seem to have the same problem.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - EndeavourOS #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 12 Dec 2025 21:39:34 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 15.02 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a tooltip is displayed in the preview of the theme editor, while styling is properly applied, transparency is not. Transparent pixels are replaced with #000000 black. This causes a discrepancy between the preview and the appearance of the tooltip in-game.\n\nThis is an example from my project:\n\n<img width=\"603\" height=\"487\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a93d045-7221-4b2b-b57f-e01cf393b737\" />\n\nAnother test by paintsimmon on Discord (in-game vs theme preview comparison):\n\n<img width=\"405\" height=\"97\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/999ccda1-09b0-4bdd-8300-94ec89728bc1\" />\n\n<img width=\"403\" height=\"105\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2407aaf7-c306-46e9-aeff-1dd066af79d1\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStarting from a new project:\n\n1. Create a theme resource.\n2. For visibility of the issue, change the `panel` constants for one or more of TooltipLabel, TooltipPanel and PopupMenu to a StyleBoxEmpty.\n3. In the preview, hover over an element with a tooltip, such as any item in the default preview's Tree. You will see the text appear over a black background.\n4. For comparison: create a scene with a control featuring a tooltip, apply the theme to it, then launch it and hover over the control. The text will appear as expected (if all three `panel` constants are StyleBoxEmpty, for instance, the text will appear by itself with no visible background).\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP featuring a theme with the `panel` constants for TooltipLabel, TooltipPanel and PopupMenu changed to a StyleBoxEmpty and a simple scene with a Tree.\n\n[mrp---tooltip-weirdness.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24526949/mrp---tooltip-weirdness.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}